=== Test 9: rejection — CASE as an operand of arithmetic ===
Expected error: CASE only as the whole aggregate argument
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CASE is supported only as the whole argument of an aggregate function, as in SUM(CASE WHEN ... THEN ... ELSE ... END). It cannot be used in arithmetic or in a THEN or ELSE of another CASE.


=== Test 10: rejection — negated CASE in AVG ===
Expected error: CASE only as the whole aggregate argument
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CASE is supported only as the whole argument of an aggregate function, as in SUM(CASE WHEN ... THEN ... ELSE ... END). It cannot be used in arithmetic or in a THEN or ELSE of another CASE.


=== Test 11: rejection — CASE in the ELSE of another CASE ===
Expected error: CASE only as the whole aggregate argument
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: CASE is supported only as the whole argument of an aggregate function, as in SUM(CASE WHEN ... THEN ... ELSE ... END). It cannot be used in arithmetic or in a THEN or ELSE of another CASE.


=== Test 12: CASE AND/OR association preserves every atom ===
== Query ==
SELECT o_custkey,
SUM(CASE WHEN o_id = 1 OR o_id = 2 OR o_id = 3 OR o_id = 4
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS or_left,
SUM(CASE WHEN o_id = 1 OR (o_id = 2 OR (o_id = 3 OR o_id = 4))
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS or_right,
SUM(CASE WHEN (o_id = 1 OR o_id = 2) OR (o_id = 3 OR o_id = 4)
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS or_balanced,
SUM(CASE WHEN o_id != 1 AND o_id != 2 AND o_id != 3 AND o_id != 4
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS and_left,
SUM(CASE WHEN o_id != 1 AND (o_id != 2 AND (o_id != 3 AND o_id != 4))
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS and_right,
SUM(CASE WHEN (o_id != 1 AND o_id != 2) AND (o_id != 3 AND o_id != 4)
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS and_balanced
FROM cte_orders
GROUP BY o_custkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

== Diff ==
==========





=== Test 13: CASE AND/OR conditions are not limited to 32 terms ===
== Query ==
SELECT o_custkey,
SUM(CASE WHEN o_id = 101 OR o_id = 102 OR o_id = 103 OR o_id = 104
OR o_id = 105 OR o_id = 106 OR o_id = 107 OR o_id = 108
OR o_id = 109 OR o_id = 110 OR o_id = 111 OR o_id = 112
OR o_id = 113 OR o_id = 114 OR o_id = 115 OR o_id = 116
OR o_id = 117 OR o_id = 118 OR o_id = 119 OR o_id = 120
OR o_id = 121 OR o_id = 122 OR o_id = 123 OR o_id = 124
OR o_id = 125 OR o_id = 126 OR o_id = 127 OR o_id = 128
OR o_id = 129 OR o_id = 130 OR o_id = 131 OR o_id = 132
OR o_id = 5
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS or_33,
SUM(CASE WHEN o_id != 101 AND o_id != 102 AND o_id != 103 AND o_id != 104
AND o_id != 105 AND o_id != 106 AND o_id != 107 AND o_id != 108
AND o_id != 109 AND o_id != 110 AND o_id != 111 AND o_id != 112
AND o_id != 113 AND o_id != 114 AND o_id != 115 AND o_id != 116
AND o_id != 117 AND o_id != 118 AND o_id != 119 AND o_id != 120
AND o_id != 121 AND o_id != 122 AND o_id != 123 AND o_id != 124
AND o_id != 125 AND o_id != 126 AND o_id != 127 AND o_id != 128
AND o_id != 129 AND o_id != 130 AND o_id != 131 AND o_id != 132
AND o_id != 5
THEN o_amt ELSE 0 END) AS and_33
FROM cte_orders
GROUP BY o_custkey;

Number of output lines, including header: 4

